{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265SbHSVTikZ1794709090.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平等12名亞太經合組織經濟體領導人，將出席APEC工商領導人峰會。</p><p></p><p>今年的APEC工商領導人峰會，周二至周三在深圳前海國際會議中心舉行，習近平會同澳洲、加拿大、智利、中國香港、印尼、韓國、馬來西亞、墨西哥、俄羅斯、泰國、越南的APEC經濟體領導人出席峰會，並發表演講、致辭或參與專題研討。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:15:19.590112+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T02:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T06:50:23.468022+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T04:08:39.525362+00:00","content_hash":"d9c5bb7d8ff013d73a8c997f337d3528cee664f7b46bfe6e71a6d6a7ac712407","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}